site/models/ — pretrained TensorFlow.js models (MobileNet v2, COCO-SSD
lite) by Google, Apache License 2.0. See site/models/README.md.

site/data/mnist_images.png, mnist_labels.bin — a 11,000-digit subset of the
MNIST database, Yann LeCun, Corinna Cortes and Christopher J.C. Burges,
licensed CC BY-SA 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/).
Regenerate with tools/build_mnist.py.

site/data/breast_cancer.json — Breast Cancer Wisconsin (Diagnostic) data set,
W. Wolberg, O. Mangasarian, N. Street and W. Street, UCI Machine Learning
Repository, https://doi.org/10.24432/C5DW2B, licensed CC BY 4.0.
Regenerate with tools/build_medical.py.

site/data/alice.txt — Lewis Carroll, Alice's Adventures in Wonderland (1865),
public domain; text from Project Gutenberg with their header and licence
removed. Regenerate with tools/build_corpus.py.

Loaded from cdn.jsdelivr.net at runtime, not redistributed here:
reveal.js (MIT), canvas-confetti (ISC), qrcode-generator (MIT),
TensorFlow.js and tfjs-models (Apache 2.0), Prism (MIT). Fonts from Google
Fonts (OFL).
